<deviceset name="7-SEGMENT-1DIGIT-1INCH" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:39406/2" library_version="2">
<description>&lt;h3&gt;7-Segment Display, single digit, 1"&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EZ is for kits. Pads are only exposed on the bottom side to help prevent soldering in upside down.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/YSD-160AR4B-8.pdf"&gt;Datasheet (Red)&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="https://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/YSD-160AB3C-8.pdf"&gt;Datasheet (Blue)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;SparkFun Products&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sparkfun.com/products/8546"&gt;7-Segment Display - LED (Red)&lt;/a&gt; (COM-08546)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9191"&gt;7-Segment Display - LED (Blue)&lt;/a&gt; (COM-09191)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
